  "reason": "The supplied BPE vocabulary assigns red=8 and bike=11. Whitespace splitting isolates the two words; explicit merges r+e then re+d give red, and b+i then bi+k then bik+e give bike. Thus red bike produces [8,11]. The empty non-NULL string produces no pieces and is valid. NULL produces declared missing ID 12 and is invalid. The three original values have piece boundaries [0,2,2,3]. Unknown ID 0 and missing ID 12 are explicitly declared, not inferred from labels.",
